   {
    "ja": "おすもん"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Mizuki Amano, a beautiful model who becomes captivated by the charm of sumo after an unexpected encounter, faces various challenges. From family issues to societal pressures and the differences between men and women, she pushes forward. However, once she steps into the sumo ring, it's all about two people facing each other and clashing with their full strength! Alongside her unique friends, she strives to assert her own will and aim for the top!",
   "ja": "ることがきっかけで相撲の魅力にとりつかれた美少女モデル・天乃みづき。家庭の問題や世間の目・・・男女の違いもあるけれど、土俵にあがれば人間と人間が本気で向きあいぶつかり合うだけ！個性的な仲間たちとともに、まっすぐ力強く自分の意志を「おすもん」！！てっぺんを目指せ！"
  },
